<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1833] VisorCache task collects wrong backup partitions information</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1833</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Current logic of VisorCache task is like this (pseudo code):&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;parts = cache.getPartitions();

&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; (part in parts) {
 &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (part.isPrimary)
   prtimCnt++;
 &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;else&lt;/span&gt;
  backupCnt++;
}
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;but we should add more checks to detect if  partition is really backup.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; (part in parts) {
 &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (part.isPrimary)
   prtimCnt++;
 &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;else&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (part.state == OWNING &amp;amp;&amp;amp; part.isBackup)
  backupCnt++;
}
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
